    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "its just kinda tight and achy, not like crazy pain or anything. i was looking online and some people said it's just part of the healing process and you just need to keep it elevated. do you think it could just be inflammation? i really dont want to deal with another hospital trip if it's just gonna be a \"wait and see\" thing anyway.",
